  (generator "konnect")
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Waveshare RP2040-Zero, surface-mounted on its edge holes. Origin = module centre, USB-C end toward -y. Hole positions from Waveshare's STEP (RP2040_ZERO_ASM, 2022-01-08): 9 + 5 + 9 plated O0.9 holes at 2.54 mm, side rows 15.24 apart, 1.39 mm inside an 18.02 x 23.52 mm board. 1.6 x 3.2 mm pads cover each hole and extend 1 mm past the module edge for an iron. Pad numbers per keyboard/docs/pcb-spec.md section 2 (1 = 5V top-left, counter-clockwise, 23 = GP0). No top copper under the module: its underside has GP17-25 test pads.")
